      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This blue-skinned birdman actually has arms, one of them holding a sturdy rod with which to smack its victims. - Imban</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 17, touch 14, flat-footed 13 (+4 Dex, +3 natural)</p><p>hp 37 [60] (5d10+10)</p><p>mp 11</p><p>Fort +3, Ref +8, Will +4</p><p>Resist earth 5, ice 10, lightning 10</p><p>Weakness wind</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft., fly 60 ft. (average)</p><p>Melee mwk light mace +10 (1d6+4), bite +7 (1d6+2), 2 talons +7 (1d4+2)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Dance</p><p>Spells Known (FC CL 5th; concentration +8)</p><p>2nd (DC 15) - Blizzard II, Thunder II</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 18, Dex 18, Con 15, Int 8, Wis 11, Cha 16</p><p>Base Atk +5; CMB +9; CMD 23</p><p>Feats Ability Focus (Dance), Flyby Attack, Multiattack</p><p>Skills Fly +12, Perception +8, Spellcraft +4</p><p>Languages Auran</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Environment mountains</p><p>Organization small group (1-3)</p><p>Treasure normal (mwk light mace, other treasure)</p>"
      }
